  "summary": "Download in pdf MONTRÉAL, July 02, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — OR Royalties Inc. (“OR Royalties” or the “Company”) (OR: TSX & NYSE) notes that today, its operating partner, Agnico Eagle Mines Limited (“Agnico Eagle”), reported that a rock mass movement occurred on July 1, 2026, along the north wall of the Barnat open pit […]",
